version: 0.4.0
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/PedroTelesFCUP/Beam_weaver"
abstract: >
  Research software for photon transport in water using thirteen disjoint
  stochastic heads trained by cross-entropy on Monte Carlo collision samples.
  The package includes a reference Monte Carlo engine, dataset generation,
  training, audited learned transport and comparison tools. Free-flight
  sampling and approximate electron/positron transport use explicit physics.
